---
description: Production SVG constraints for MEG glyphs
globs: assets/**/*.svg,packages/**/*.svg
alwaysApply: false
---

# MEG SVG (MEGS-0001 / 0006)

- MUST: `viewBox="0 0 64 64"`
- MUST: primary geometry uses `currentColor`
- MUST: default `stroke-width="2.5"` unless metadata documents an exception
- SHOULD: root `fill="none"` when stroke-led
- MUST NOT: editor namespaces, scripts, rasters, hard-coded theme colors for meaning
- Filename MUST be `snake_case.svg` matching glyph `id`

```xml
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
```
